{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNdGKbizJCZ2SY1qXAnH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The change does what T2 asks and nothing it forbids.\n\n- **Overdraw:** `remove` now raises `ValueError` when `qty` is greater than the stock for that SKU. An unknown SKU counts as 0 in stock, so any positive removal from it raises.\n- **Refused removal:** the check runs before the stock is modified, so a refused removal leaves the stock unchanged.\n- **Exact removal:** removing exactly the quantity in stock passes the check and leaves 0.\n- **Unknown SKU:** `self._stock[sku] -= qty` is only reached when `qty <= stock`. With `qty > 0` that means the key already exists, so there is no `KeyError`.\n- **Existing behaviour:** the `qty <= 0` check is unchanged, and the diff touches nothing else.\n\nI only read the task statement and the diff. I didn't run any tests.\n\nWIP-REVIEW WIP-NONCE:55be6e827fe7ed8f edf8ff4915eff1ebf0c868897cb1c3c66aced115 approve\nOPEN_FLEET_WORKER_DONE disp_ee0916fdca succeeded"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":745,"cache_read_input_tokens":17709,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":745,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd42b020-acbf-4100-b4c3-25b519e6890c","uuid":"6bbe586f-cc9a-493b-aace-baa31ee236c5","timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:17:59.223Z","request_id":"req_011CgNdGKDAKnoeNuo4kuoxe"}
